{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“一想到这个人就柔软起来，很想亲近”保留了 v6 的核心心理事实，“连自己都没料到心意来得这么快”是对开场突发感的主观转写，没有把音乐变化直接写成心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"舍不得退开与主动克制之间的矛盾、对相处可能变拘谨的顾虑以及尚未想透的状态，能够对应珠子中的谨慎心理，没有把准备说话的比喻写成真实对白或事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“决定两人以后怎样”把 v6 中泛指的暂时不必作决定，具体化成了关于两人未来关系的决策，超出了现有线索能够确定的范围。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能读出从突然产生亲近感，到舍不得退开却又克制，最后仍不确定如何自在靠近的心理过程。\",\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R4\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"R4 中“这点喜欢轻得仿佛随时可以放下”的轻盈、似乎容易放下的心理特征没有保留下来；“舍不得退开”只承接了不舍的一面，不能替代前半层意思。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S01-2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“靠近时便收住”后又说“自己也没想透为何要收住”，同一句重复使用“收住”，可以压缩而不损失心理事实。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "42df3f5b-4c53-4d85-911e-fad494459cef", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T164413605111Z", "elapsed_seconds": 410.062, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T16:51:03.675899+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "17d5f9f2eb8a6fa593ab59fb6900b227c068764ac6cf3f7eeb0598613b53c542", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7